  "text": "### 8. Liquidity Risk  \n**Appetite:** Conservative  \n**Tolerance:**\n- **Loan-to-Deposit Ratio:** <90%\n- **Liquid Assets Buffer:** 30 days+ operating expenses\n- **Maturity Mismatch:** <6 months average  \n**Rationale:**\nFirstUK Bank maintains strong liquidity to meet customer withdrawals and operational needs. Does not rely on external funding.  \n**Controls:**\n- Deposit mix management\n- Liquidity forecasting\n- Asset-liability management\n- Borrowing facilities (backup)\n- Stress testing (liquidity scenarios)  \n---",
